      "y": 272,
      "width": 338.0,
      "height": 96,
      "text": "Single point of failure — any crash takes down entire system\nCannot scale horizontally — constrained by one machine's CPU/RAM\nNo redundancy — data loss risk on disk failure\nMaintenance requires complete downtime",
